      "profile": {
        "biography": {
          "text": "19:26 is an Italian electronic artist merging cinematic emotion, melodic depth and forward-thinking club music into a distinctive world of his own.\n\nFollowing acclaimed releases on Afterlife and Siamese, including his defining track “XX” and The Passage EP, 19:26 has rapidly expanded his international profile through collaborations with Anyma, first on “Giza” and later on “Prophecy” , released on Anyma’s Æden label. In 2026, he also made his Drumcode debut with “Dancing”, further extending his sound beyond conventional genre boundaries.\n\nAt the center of the project is  THE PASSAGE BETWEEN WORLDS, 19:26’s proprietary audiovisual show and evolving narrative universe. Built around themes of identity, transformation and the tension between memory and the future, the show connects music, cinematic storytelling, recurring characters and visual symbolism into a continuously developing live experience.\n\nFrom the Pyramids of Giza to UNVRS Ibiza, Space Miami, Kappa FuturFestival, Afterlife, Zamna and major stages around the world, 19:26 has developed a reputation for emotionally charged sets that combine precision, tension and release.\n\nRather than being defined by a single genre, 19:26 is building a language of his own, where music, performance and storytelling exist as parts of the same universe.",
          "type": "AUTOBIOGRAPHY"
        },
